    <id>imageflow</id>
    <name>ImageFlow</name>
    <summary>Fast and safe photo triage for large folders</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
ImageFlow helps users sort large image folders in Nextcloud with Flow-based workflows, fast keyboard-driven triage, background queues, and explicit execution control.

The first implementation is intentionally conservative: sorting decisions are recorded as planned operations, while file writes are reserved for the controlled execution queue and safe-mode validation.
]]></description>
